    "body": "It seems this would be rather magical as https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/form-control-infrastructure.html#constructing-the-form-data-set has an early return for an empty form. I guess we would have to pretend that the form contains the submitter in this case.\r\n\r\nPerhaps you could elaborate on when this kind of thing has come up?",
